<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>LaveriePro — Investir dans une laverie automatique</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #1a1a18;
    --ink2: #4a4a46;
    --ink3: #8a8a84;
    --bg: #fafaf7;
    --bg2: #f2f2ed;
    --bg3: #e8e8e0;
    --accent: #2a6e4e;
    --accent2: #1d9e75;
    --accent-light: #e1f5ee;
    --warn: #c84b1a;
    --warn-light: #faece7;
    --gold: #b07d2a;
    --gold-light: #faeeda;
    --radius: 12px;
    --radius-sm: 8px;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,h4 { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.2; }

  /* NAV */
  nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(250,250,247,0.92);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bg3);
    padding: 0 5%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    height: 60px;
  }
  .nav-brand { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 20px; color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 32px; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 400; transition: color .2s; }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  .nav-cta { background: var(--accent); color: white; border: none; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 500; transition: background .2s; text-decoration: none; }
  .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--accent2); }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    min-height: 88vh;
    padding: 0 5%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-tag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 64px); color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .hero h1 em { font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
  .hero-sub { font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink2); margin-bottom: 36px; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: white; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: background .2s, transform .15s; border: none; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent2); transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-outline { background: transparent; color: var(--ink); padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; border: 1px solid var(--bg3); transition: border-color .2s, background .2s; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; }
  .btn-outline:hover { border-color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); }

  .hero-card {
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--bg3);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }
  .hero-card-title { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink3); margin-bottom: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-weight: 500; }
  .hero-stat { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bg2); }
  .hero-stat:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .hero-stat-label { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); }
  .hero-stat-val { font-size: 18px; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; color: var(--ink); }
  .hero-stat-val.green { color: var(--accent); }
  .hero-badge { margin-top: 20px; background: var(--accent-light); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 12px 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .hero-badge-text { font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500; }

  /* STATS BAND */
  .stats-band { background: var(--ink); padding: 48px 5%; }
  .stats-band-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  .stat-item { text-align: center; }
  .stat-num { font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; font-size: 40px; color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .stat-label { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
  .stat-unit { font-size: 20px; color: var(--accent2); }

  /* SECTIONS */
  .section { padding: 80px 5%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .section-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .section-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .section-header h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .section-header p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink2); max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300; }

  /* ATOUTS */
  .atouts-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .atout-card { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--bg3); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px; transition: box-shadow .2s, transform .2s; }
  .atout-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .atout-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .icon-green { background: var(--accent-light); }
  .icon-gold { background: var(--gold-light); }
  .icon-blue { background: #e6f1fb; }
  .atout-card h3 { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .atout-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; }

  /* MODELES */
  .modeles-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .modele-card { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--bg3); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px; position: relative; }
  .modele-card.featured { border: 2px solid var(--accent); }
  .modele-badge { position: absolute; top: -12px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: var(--accent); color: white; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .modele-emoji { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px; display: block; }
  .modele-card h3 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .modele-card .tagline { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink3); margin-bottom: 18px; font-weight: 300; }
  .modele-pros { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .modele-pros li { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink2); padding: 4px 0; display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .modele-pros li::before { content: '✓'; color: var(--accent2); font-weight: 500; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .modele-cons li::before { content: '×'; color: var(--warn); }

  /* SIMULATEUR */
  #simulateur { background: var(--bg2); padding: 80px 5%; }
  .sim-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .sim-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: start; }
  .sim-panel { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--bg3); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 28px; }
  .sim-panel h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--ink); }
  .sim-row { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .sim-row label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink2); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .sim-row label span { font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
  input[type=range] {
    width: 100%; height: 4px; -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none;
    background: var(--bg3); border-radius: 2px; outline: none; cursor: pointer;
  }
  input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
    -webkit-appearance: none; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent); cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-light);
  }
  input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track { height: 4px; border-radius: 2px; }
  .sim-divider { height: 1px; background: var(--bg2); margin: 20px 0; }

  .sim-results { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .kpi-grid2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
  .kpi2 { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--bg3); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 16px; text-align: center; }
  .kpi2-val { font-size: 22px; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .kpi2-val.green { color: var(--accent); }
  .kpi2-val.red { color: var(--warn); }
  .kpi2-val.gold { color: var(--gold); }
  .kpi2-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .chart-box { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--bg3); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 24px; }
  .chart-box h4 { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; }
  .chart-wrap { position: relative; height: 220px; }
  .detail-box { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--bg3); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; }
  .detail-box table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
  .detail-box thead th { background: var(--bg2); padding: 10px 16px; text-align: left; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .detail-box thead th:not(:first-child) { text-align: right; }
  .detail-box tbody td { padding: 10px 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--bg2); color: var(--ink); }
  .detail-box tbody td:not(:first-child) { text-align: right; }
  .detail-box tbody tr:hover { background: var(--bg2); }
  .pos { color: var(--accent); }
  .neg { color: var(--warn); }

  .verdict-box { border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 20px 24px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
  .verdict-box.good { background: var(--accent-light); border: 1px solid #9fe1cb; }
  .verdict-box.warn { background: var(--gold-light); border: 1px solid #fac775; }
  .verdict-box.bad { background: var(--warn-light); border: 1px solid #f5c4b3; }
  .verdict-icon { font-size: 32px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .verdict-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
  .verdict-sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink2); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.5; }

  /* PIÈGES */
  .pieges-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .piege-card { display: flex; gap: 16px; background: white; border: 1px solid var(--bg3); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 20px 24px; }
  .piege-num { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--warn-light); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .piege-card h4 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 4px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; }
  .piege-card p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 300; }

  /* ÉTAPES */
  .etapes-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .etape { display: flex; gap: 24px; position: relative; }
  .etape-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .etape-num { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); color: white; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 16px; font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif; flex-shrink: 0; z-index: 1; }
  .etape-line { flex: 1; width: 1px; background: var(--bg3); margin: 4px 0; min-height: 32px; }
  .etape:last-child .etape-line { display: none; }
  .etape-content { padding-bottom: 32px; }
  .etape-content h3 { font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 6px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; }
  .etape-content p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink2); line-height: 1.6; font-weight: 300; }
  .etape-tag { display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; background: var(--bg2); color: var(--ink3); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }

  /* CONTACT */
  #contact { background: var(--ink); padding: 80px 5%; }
  .contact-inner { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .contact-inner h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px); color: white; margin-bottom: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .contact-inner p { font-size: 16px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin-bottom: 36px; font-weight: 300; }
  .contact-form { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 32px; text-align: left; }
  .form-row { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .form-row label { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; font-weight: 500; }
  .form-row input, .form-row textarea, .form-row select {
    width: 100%; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
    color: white; font-size: 14px; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    outline: none; transition: border-color .2s;
  }
  .form-row input::placeholder, .form-row textarea::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
  .form-row input:focus, .form-row textarea:focus { border-color: var(--accent2); }
  .form-row textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }
  .form-row select option { background: var(--ink); }
  .form-2col { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  .btn-submit { width: 100%; background: var(--accent2); color: white; border: none; padding: 14px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; cursor: pointer; transition: background .2s; margin-top: 8px; }
  .btn-submit:hover { background: var(--accent); }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer { background: var(--ink); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding: 24px 5%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  footer p { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
  footer a { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-decoration: none; }

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; min-height: auto; padding: 60px 5%; }
    .stats-band-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    .atouts-grid, .modeles-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .sim-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .kpi-grid2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr); }
    .pieges-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .form-2col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .nav-links { display: none; }
  }

  /* ANIMATIONS */
  @keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity:0; transform:translateY(20px); } to { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }
  .fade-up { opacity:0; animation: fadeUp .6s ease forwards; }
  .delay-1 { animation-delay: .1s; }
  .delay-2 { animation-delay: .2s; }
  .delay-3 { animation-delay: .3s; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <a class="nav-brand" href="#">LaveriePro</a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#atouts">Pourquoi investir</a></li>
    <li><a href="#modeles">Modèles</a></li>
    <li><a href="#simulateur">Simulateur</a></li>
    <li><a href="#pieges">Pièges</a></li>
    <li><a href="#etapes">Étapes</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Être accompagné</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <div class="hero-tag fade-up">💼 Guide investisseur 2025</div>
    <h1 class="fade-up delay-1">Investir dans une <em>laverie automatique</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub fade-up delay-2">Un actif tangible, cash-flow positif dès la première année, gérable en autonomie. Découvrez les chiffres réels et simulez votre projet.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions fade-up delay-3">
      <a href="#simulateur" class="btn-primary">Simuler mon investissement</a>
      <a href="#atouts" class="btn-outline">Voir les atouts</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-card fade-up delay-2">
    <div class="hero-card-title">Profil type d'une laverie</div>
    <div class="hero-stat"><span class="hero-stat-label">Investissement total</span><span class="hero-stat-val">80 000 – 200 000 €</span></div>
    <div class="hero-stat"><span class="hero-stat-label">CA annuel moyen</span><span class="hero-stat-val">60 000 – 130 000 €</span></div>
    <div class="hero-stat"><span class="hero-stat-label">Marge nette</span><span class="hero-stat-val green">20 – 35 %</span></div>
    <div class="hero-stat"><span class="hero-stat-label">Retour sur investissement</span><span class="hero-stat-val">4 à 8 ans</span></div>
    <div class="hero-stat"><span class="hero-stat-label">Nb machines (8–20 kg)</span><span class="hero-stat-val">6 à 16 unités</span></div>
    <div class="hero-badge">
      <span>✅</span>
      <span class="hero-badge-text">Paiement comptant · Zéro impayé · Demande incompressible</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>

<!-- STATS BAND -->
<div class="stats-band">
  <div class="stats-band-inner">
    <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">12 000<span class="stat-unit">+</span></div><div class="stat-label">Laveries en France</div></div>
    <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">7j/7</div><div class="stat-label">Activité continue</div></div>
    <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">0</div><div class="stat-label">Salarié nécessaire</div></div>
    <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">25<span class="stat-unit">%</span></div><div class="stat-label">Marge nette médiane</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ATOUTS -->
<section class="section" id="atouts">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-tag">Pourquoi ce secteur</span>
    <h2>Un modèle économique solide</h2>
    <p>La laverie automatique cumule des avantages rares dans le monde de l'investissement PME.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="atouts-grid">
    <div class="atout-card">
      <div class="atout-icon icon-green">💶</div>
      <h3>Cash-flow immédiat</h3>
      <p>Paiement comptant à chaque cycle. Zéro créance client, zéro risque d'impayé. La trésorerie est disponible en temps réel.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="atout-card">
      <div class="atout-icon icon-gold">👤</div>
      <h3>Quasi-autonome</h3>
      <p>Avec la télésurveillance et le télépaiement, aucun salarié n'est nécessaire. Une intervention hebdomadaire suffit pour l'entretien courant.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="atout-card">
      <div class="atout-icon icon-blue">📈</div>
      <h3>Demande incompressible</h3>
      <p>La lessive est un besoin primaire. La laverie automatique résiste aux crises économiques et à la concurrence du e-commerce.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="atout-card">
      <div class="atout-icon icon-green">🏠</div>
      <h3>Actif tangible</h3>
      <p>Machines, local, clientèle fidèle : un fonds de commerce valorisable et revendable sur la base d'un multiple d'EBE.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="atout-card">
      <div class="atout-icon icon-gold">📅</div>
      <h3>Horaires étendus</h3>
      <p>7j/7, souvent de 6h à 22h voire 24h. Chaque heure supplémentaire d'ouverture est du CA additionnel sans coût marginal.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="atout-card">
      <div class="atout-icon icon-blue">🔧</div>
      <h3>Optimisation possible</h3>
      <p>Ajustement tarifaire, mix machines, séchoirs, distributeurs — de nombreux leviers permettent d'augmenter le CA sans changer de local.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MODELES -->
<section class="section" id="modeles" style="background:var(--bg2);max-width:100%;padding:80px 5%;">
  <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-tag">Modes d'entrée</span>
    <h2>Quel modèle choisir ?</h2>
    <p>Trois façons d'entrer sur ce marché, selon votre profil et votre niveau de risque accepté.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="modeles-grid">
    <div class="modele-card">
      <span class="modele-emoji">🏗️</span>
      <h3>Création from scratch</h3>
